==Trivia==
*In real life, [[wikipedia:Betelgeuse|Betelgeuse]] is the ninth-brightest star in the night sky and the second-brightest star in the constellation of [[wikipedia:Orion (constellation)|Orion]], the stage's [[Treasure]]. It is one of the largest and most luminous stars visible to the naked eye.

